### 1.1 Seeder la base de données
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/seed?numWallets=10&eventsPerWallet=100

### 1.2 Créer un nouveau portefeuille
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "email": "testclient@gmail.com",
  "initialBalance": 25000,
  "code": "WLT-TEST001",
  "currency": "XOF"
}

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 0, taille 10
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=0&size=10

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 0, taille 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=0&size=5

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 1, taille 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=1&size=5